# Cargo
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock

# Local CC prompts
prompts/
# ...but not the benchmark's frozen model prompts (bench/DESIGN.md).
!bench/prompts/

# Local Quorum state
# Reviews are per-machine artifacts and should not be committed.
# Config and conventions are intentionally trackable (see CLAUDE.md
# "Tracked vs untracked input distinction"): users `git add` them
# explicitly when they want to share project bindings or shared
# review conventions with teammates.
.quorum/reviews/
# The dismissals store (and its -wal/-shm files) holds free-text dismissal
# notes and is never shared. Quorum appends this line itself on first use
# (quorum-core memory/gitignore.rs) when it is missing.
.quorum/dismissals.sqlite*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# Local dev credentials, never commit
.env

# Benchmark harness (v0.6 Stage 1, AC 247): materialized repos, raw run
# outputs and vendor keys stay local.
bench/.cache/
bench/runs/
bench/.env.local

# CarryForward / cross-project spec drops (not Quorum content). Anchored
# to the root so that benchmark cases' `packages/...` paths are tracked.
/packages/
